### Classes as Dependencies
### ============================================

### 1. GET items - default parameters
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/

###

### 2. GET items - with search query
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/?q=Foo

###

### 3. GET items - with pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/?skip=1&limit=2

###

### 4. GET users - default parameters
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/